# SQLite — per-feature db files are legacy; central db is ~/.pathly/pathly.db
pathly/plans/**/*.db
pathly/plans/**/*.db-wal
pathly/plans/**/*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# EVENTS.jsonl — per-feature disk mirror of the DB-authoritative fsm_events log (event
# disk-mirror, state-one-authority). The central DB is the runtime source of record; the
# exporter (event_mirror.py) rewrites this file DB->disk on every server start + event append,
# so tracking it churns. Same treatment as BOARD.json below. To ship a FINISHED feature's
# event log with the repo (frozen → no churn), force-add it:
#   git add -f pathly/features/<name>/EVENTS.jsonl
pathly/**/EVENTS.jsonl
# Safety net: a repo-root EVENTS.jsonl is never a legitimate tracked file (production event
# logs always live under pathly/); only a project-root-as-storage-path edge case emits one.
/EVENTS.jsonl
# ARTIFACTS.jsonl — DROPPED (state-one-authority). Was an agent-written import ledger for a
# stage's declared outputs; that metadata already lives in BOARD.json, and reconcile now attaches
# a stage's <out_path> from the FSM's own record (no ledger). Nothing writes or reads it anymore,
# so any straggler on disk is a dead file — never tracked.
pathly/**/ARTIFACTS.jsonl
/ARTIFACTS.jsonl
# BOARD.json — per-board disk mirror of the DB-authoritative comms board (board disk-mirror).
# Rewritten on every board write, so tracking it churns; the DB is the source and P2 hydration
# rebuilds boards from these files LOCALLY (DB-loss recovery), not just on fresh clones. To ship
# a FINISHED board with the repo (frozen → no churn), force-add it:
#   git add -f pathly/features/<name>/BOARD.json
pathly/**/BOARD.json
# Transient per-file AI capture artifacts (file-based result capture, read into the DB then dead):
#   AI Summary (.summary) · AI Split (.draft) · AI Analyze (.analysis)
#   MD-editor gallery sidecars (accumulate one entry per run): .analyses.json / .diagrams.json /
#   .comments.json, plus the AI-Split working draft (.split.draft) — all per-user editor scratch.
*.summary
*.md.draft
*.md.analysis
*.md.analyses.json
*.md.diagrams.json
*.md.comments.json
*.md.split.draft
# Board artifact copies — duplicates of plan diagrams, written on "Add to board"
pathly/board-artifacts/

# code-intel (codebase-memory-mcp) + serena local index + project cache
.serena/
.codebase-memory-mcp/
